1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:02,480
This is a photo.

2
00:00:05,050 --> 00:00:11,480
These are twelve. Shared with people
you know... and people you don't.

3
00:00:13,050 --> 00:00:16,480
To a stranger, every photo is a clue.

4
00:00:20,050 --> 00:00:25,480
A house number. A school crest.
A boarding pass.

5
00:00:27,050 --> 00:00:33,980
On their own, harmless. Together, they
tell a story you never meant to share.

6
00:00:36,050 --> 00:00:38,480
Introducing Clueproof.

7
00:00:41,050 --> 00:00:45,980
It reads your photos the way a stranger
would... before anyone else can.

8
00:00:48,050 --> 00:00:53,806
And it runs entirely on your UGREEN
AI NAS. Your photos never leave home.

9
00:00:53,856 --> 00:00:55,980
Not even to be checked.

10
00:00:58,050 --> 00:01:00,980
Just ask: is this safe to post?

11
00:01:03,050 --> 00:01:09,980
Three lines. Six photos are ready to post.
Four give clues away. Two need a fix.

12
00:01:12,050 --> 00:01:16,950
Every photo is read twice: once for text,
once for what's in the picture.

13
00:01:17,000 --> 00:01:22,980
It never calls a photo safe on a single
look. And it never repeats what it found.

14
00:01:25,050 --> 00:01:30,980
Say yes, and your clean photos are
ready to share. The rest are remembered.

15
00:01:33,050 --> 00:01:38,480
Then ask the bigger question.
What could a stranger find out about us?

16
00:01:40,050 --> 00:01:45,832
Clueproof opens the Stranger's File.
Eight pages a stranger would try to fill.

17
00:01:45,882 --> 00:01:50,480
Where you live. Your children.
Your car. When you're away.

18
00:01:52,050 --> 00:01:55,480
And it shows you how to close every page.

19
00:01:57,050 --> 00:02:01,980
Clueproof. Share the moment.
Not the clues.
